      "bottomRightX": 636,
      "bottomRightY": 425,
      "content": "Note that this mechanism is used very frequently with 1394 DCAM compliant cameras where the whole standard register block has a common base address that must be parsed from a IEEE 1212 configuration ROM structure at run-time (see also the ConfRom node type).",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
